{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "_doc": "Drop this at /etc/hailo/sv4e_modes.json (or set HAILO_SV4E_MODES_JSON) and restart isp_media_server to override the SV4E mode list. Validation is fail-closed: any invalid entry rejects the whole file. Bounds: width<=3840, height<=2160, bit_width==12. Bayer: RGGB|GBRG|GRBG|BGGR. hdr_mode: linear (HDR variants deferred). fps must be 30 (other values produce wrong AE timing — non-30 fps support pending). 'index' values MUST be dense from 0..N-1 (the higher-level Sensor::queryGet enumerator iterates from 0 and stops at the first miss; non-dense indices silently hide later modes). All ae_info fields are optional and default to the values shown below.",
